[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSS012
TITLE: A conflict probe shall see collisions the occupancy flag cannot
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall predict surface and runway conflicts from truth tracks before a routine clearance is proposed. The prediction shall cover a synthetic taxi graph, runway incursion, classic wake categories heavy, B757, large, and small, and same-runway time separation. LAHSO, visual separation, opposite direction, and intersection departures shall be detected and shall not be proposed as routine. Acceptance is a departure whose predicted runway time overlaps an arrival, with no routine clearance proposed, and an intersection departure that is deferred.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Exclusive occupancy does not see two aircraft on the same pavement in time, or a vehicle on the runway.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: System
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Wake RECAT, PRM, full approach control, enroute separation, and a live NAS connection are outside this increment. The probe proposes. It does not write an issued clearance.
RELATIONS:
